## Part 8 — Field & Group Wrappers

### 8.1 Field wrapper (single control)
```html
<div class="ds-field">
  <label class="ds-field__label">Label <span class="ds-field__required">*</span></label>
  <!-- control -->
  <span class="ds-field__caption">Helper text</span>
</div>
```

### 8.2 Fieldset wrapper (grouped controls)
```html
<fieldset class="ds-fieldset">
  <legend class="ds-fieldset__legend">Choices <span class="ds-fieldset__required">*</span></legend>
  <span class="ds-fieldset__caption">Helper text</span>
  <div class="ds-fieldset__items"><!-- radios/checkboxes --></div>
  <span class="ds-fieldset__validation ds-fieldset__validation--error">Error message</span>
</fieldset>
```

